<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<!--
  Default strings — English.

  English is the fallback: a device set to a language without its own
  values-<lang>/ folder falls back here rather than showing a language the user
  may not read. Translations live in values-vi/ and values-zh/.

  Keep every file's key set identical. A missing key silently falls back to
  English mid-screen, which looks like a bug rather than a translation gap.
-->
